                                <span class="text-blue-500 font-bold">•</span> Inicio Rápido (.NET 10)
                            </a>
                            <a href="#git-cli" class="flex items-center gap-2.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-800 font-medium transition">
                                <span class="text-blue-500 font-bold">•</span> Uso del CLI (<code>./dev.sh</code>)
